[{"client_msg_id":"c9c632df-dbe0-4c47-b4b1-5293a2ddbe43","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"うがいはインフルエンザやコロナの感染予防に効果がある科学的根拠がないという話もあるみたいです。","ts":"1637494365.282100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fearful","count":1,"users":["U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"majika","count":2,"users":["U782D5DF1","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jHP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e099ee5c-49fd-427f-aef3-f68221c9b378","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"他の人がいない状況でやるのがいちばんだろうけど、学校にいったらむずかしいかもだし、やむをえないかな?\nそこはもうリスクテイキングの度合いの問題な気がする","ts":"1637492597.281300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uXr=/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4E8FBA98-EC3F-4B9E-8407-5C0DBF942CA8","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ちょうど今日、知人のお子さんが通っている小学校(たしか公立)でうがい歯磨きを禁止されていると耳にしたので、同じ日本でもいろいろあるんだなあと\n飛沫が出るから感染拡大予防で、とかなんですかね…","ts":"1637492518.280200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tD+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e85bf79e-57c0-40dd-b916-26e86d3a33f1","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"あの辺りは乾燥してるからな・・・","ts":"1637491665.276800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9pymC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79ddc4ce-c4c4-4821-9035-757bb08059ba","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"ドイツほどの先進国でも国民があまりマスクしたがらない、みたいな記事を読んで教育難しいと思った（こなみ）","ts":"1637491447.276300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1e38Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5b2dae8-2ef5-497e-8f9f-95ff03bf57f8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://web.sapmed.ac.jp/canmol/coronavirus/case_vaccine.html?d=1\u0026amp;p=1\u0026amp;x=1\u0026amp;xmin=0.1\u0026amp;y=3\u0026amp;df=7\u0026amp;f=y\u0026amp;n=j\u0026amp;kw=Jap